          { "text": "労作時は酸素流量を増やす", "correct": true }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "呼吸リハビリ",
      "background": "home_bedroom",
      "bgm": "heartwarming",
      "cuts": [
        { "id": "s06_01", "speaker": "yamada", "text": "聖隷さん、今日は呼吸リハビリをしましょう。体力を維持するためにとても大切なんですよ。", "characters": ["kazuo", "yamada"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "yamada", "position": "right", "expression": "yamada_01_smile"}] },
        { "id": "s06_02", "speaker": "kazuo", "text": "リハビリか。正直、苦しくなるのが怖くてあまりやっていないんだ。", "characters": ["kazuo", "yamada"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_02_worried"}, {"id": "yamada", "position": "right", "expression": "yamada_05_neutral"}] },
        { "id": "s06_03", "speaker": "yamada", "text": "そうですよね。でも、動かないでいると筋力が落ちて、もっと息切れしやすくなってしまうんです。", "characters": ["kazuo", "yamada"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "yamada", "position": "right", "expression": "yamada_07_serious"}] },
        { "id": "s06_04", "speaker": "yamada", "text": "まず、口すぼめ呼吸を練習しましょう。鼻から吸って、口をすぼめてゆっくり吐きます。吐く時間を吸う時間の2倍くらいにするのがコツです。", "characters": ["kazuo", "yamada"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "yamada", "position": "right", "expression": "yamada_05_neutral"}] },
        { "id": "s06_05", "speaker": "kazuo", "text": "こうですか？フーッ。", "characters": ["kazuo", "yamada"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_medical_03_pursed_lip"}, {"id": "yamada", "position": "right", "expression": "yamada_05_neutral"}] },
        { "id": "s06_06", "speaker": "yamada", "text": "上手です！この呼吸法は、気道が狭くなるのを防いで、息を吐きやすくしてくれます。苦しくなった時にも使えますよ。", "characters": ["kazuo", "yamada"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_01_smile"}, {"id": "yamada", "position": "right", "expression": "yamada_01_smile"}] },
        { "id": "s06_07", "speaker": "kazuo", "text": "体力が戻ったら、家族と外食に行きたいと思ってるんだ。温泉旅行も夢だけどね。", "characters": ["kazuo", "yamada"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_01_smile"}, {"id": "yamada", "position": "right", "expression": "yamada_05_neutral"}] },
        { "id": "s06_08", "speaker": "yamada", "text": "それは素敵な目標ですね！外食に行けるように、一緒に頑張りましょう。", "characters": ["kazuo", "yamada"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_01_smile"}, {"id": "yamada", "position": "right", "expression": "yamada_01_smile"}] }
      ],
      "knowledge": {
        "title": "口すぼめ呼吸の効果",
        "text": "【口すぼめ呼吸のメカニズム】\n①呼気時の気道内圧を高め、気道の虚脱を防ぐ\n②呼気時間を延長し、肺内の空気を効率よく排出\n③呼吸数を減らし、呼吸仕事量を軽減\n④日常生活動作中の息切れを軽減"
      },
      "quiz": {
        "question": "COPD患者の呼吸困難時に有効な呼吸法はどれか？",
        "options": [
          { "text": "胸式呼吸", "correct": false },
          { "text": "口すぼめ呼吸", "correct": true },
          { "text": "努力呼吸", "correct": false },
          { "text": "過換気", "correct": false }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "薬局",
      "background": "pharmacy",
      "bgm": "heartwarming",
      "cuts": [
        { "id": "s07_01", "speaker": "kazuo", "text": "処方箋を持ってきました。", "characters": ["kazuo", "pharmacist"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "pharmacist", "position": "right", "expression": "pharmacist_05_neutral"}] },
        { "id": "s07_02", "speaker": "pharmacist", "text": "聖隷さん、こんにちは。今回のお薬を確認しますね。吸入薬のスピリーバは、毎日同じ時間に使っていますか？", "characters": ["kazuo", "pharmacist"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "pharmacist", "position": "right", "expression": "pharmacist_01_smile"}] },
        { "id": "s07_03", "speaker": "kazuo", "text": "朝と夜に使っています。忘れたことはないですよ。", "characters": ["kazuo", "pharmacist"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_01_smile"}, {"id": "pharmacist", "position": "right", "expression": "pharmacist_05_neutral"}] },
        { "id": "s07_04", "speaker": "pharmacist", "text": "素晴らしいですね。吸入後はうがいを忘れずにしてくださいね。口腔カンジダの予防になります。", "characters": ["kazuo", "pharmacist"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "pharmacist", "position": "right", "expression": "pharmacist_01_smile"}] },
        { "id": "s07_05", "speaker": "pharmacist", "text": "プレドニゾロンは炎症を抑えるお薬ですが、長期使用で骨粗鬆症のリスクがありますので、カルシウムを意識して摂ってくださいね。", "characters": ["kazuo", "pharmacist"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "pharmacist", "position": "right", "expression": "pharmacist_07_serious"}] },
        { "id": "s07_06", "speaker": "kazuo", "text": "わかりました。牛乳を飲むようにします。", "characters": ["kazuo", "pharmacist"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "pharmacist", "position": "right", "expression": "pharmacist_01_smile"}] }
