    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "かかりつけ医受診",
      "background": "clinic",
      "bgm": "medical",
      "cuts": [
        { "id": "s08_01", "speaker": "doctor", "text": "聖隷さん、退院後1ヶ月ですね。調子はいかがですか？", "characters": ["kazuo", "doctor"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "doctor", "position": "right", "expression": "doctor_01_smile"}] },
        { "id": "s08_02", "speaker": "kazuo", "text": "おかげさまで、大きく悪くなることはなく過ごせています。", "characters": ["kazuo", "doctor"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_01_smile"}, {"id": "doctor", "position": "right", "expression": "doctor_05_neutral"}] },
        { "id": "s08_03", "speaker": "doctor", "text": "訪問看護の記録を見ると、SpO2も安定していますね。体重が少し減っているのが気になりますが。", "characters": ["kazuo", "doctor"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "doctor", "position": "right", "expression": "doctor_02_worried"}] },
        { "id": "s08_04", "speaker": "kazuo", "text": "食欲はあるんですが、あまり量が食べられなくて。", "characters": ["kazuo", "doctor"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_02_worried"}, {"id": "doctor", "position": "right", "expression": "doctor_05_neutral"}] },
        { "id": "s08_05", "speaker": "doctor", "text": "COPDの方は呼吸にエネルギーを使うので、体重が減りやすいんです。少量でも高カロリーなものを摂るようにしてください。", "characters": ["kazuo", "doctor"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "doctor", "position": "right", "expression": "doctor_05_neutral"}] },
        { "id": "s08_06", "speaker": "doctor", "text": "感染予防も大切です。人混みは避けて、手洗いうがいを徹底してくださいね。インフルエンザと肺炎球菌のワクチンは接種していますか？", "characters": ["kazuo", "doctor"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "doctor", "position": "right", "expression": "doctor_07_serious"}] },
        { "id": "s08_07", "speaker": "kazuo", "text": "インフルエンザは毎年打っています。肺炎球菌は5年前に打ちました。", "characters": ["kazuo", "doctor"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "doctor", "position": "right", "expression": "doctor_05_neutral"}] },
        { "id": "s08_08", "speaker": "doctor", "text": "では次回、肺炎球菌ワクチンの再接種も検討しましょう。", "characters": ["kazuo", "doctor"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "doctor", "position": "right", "expression": "doctor_01_smile"}] }
      ],
      "knowledge": {
        "title": "COPD患者の栄養管理",
        "text": "【なぜ体重が減るのか】\nCOPD患者は呼吸筋の仕事量増加により、安静時でも健常者の1.2-1.5倍のエネルギーを消費します。\n\n【栄養指導のポイント】\n・高カロリー・高タンパク食\n・少量頻回食（1日5-6回）\n・炭水化物過剰摂取は避ける"
      },
