      "title": "ケアマネ訪問",
      "background": "home_living",
      "bgm": "heartwarming",
      "cuts": [
        { "id": "s09_01", "speaker": "sato", "text": "聖隷さん、奥様、こんにちは。ケアマネジャーの佐藤です。サービスの利用状況を確認させてください。", "characters": ["kazuo", "ichiko", "sato"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "sato", "position": "right", "expression": "sato_01_smile"}] },
        { "id": "s09_02", "speaker": "ichiko", "text": "訪問看護のおかげで、私も少し楽になりました。", "characters": ["kazuo", "ichiko", "sato"], "expressions": [{"id": "ichiko", "position": "left", "expression": "ichiko_01_smile"}, {"id": "sato", "position": "right", "expression": "sato_05_neutral"}] },
        { "id": "s09_03", "speaker": "sato", "text": "それは良かったです。介護する奥様の健康も大切ですからね。", "characters": ["kazuo", "ichiko", "sato"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "sato", "position": "right", "expression": "sato_01_smile"}] },
        { "id": "s09_04", "speaker": "sato", "text": "訪問入浴や、レスパイト入院といったサービスもあります。必要なときは遠慮なく相談してくださいね。", "characters": ["kazuo", "ichiko", "sato"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_02_worried"}, {"id": "sato", "position": "right", "expression": "sato_05_neutral"}] },
        { "id": "s09_05", "speaker": "kazuo", "text": "そういうサービスがあるのは心強いです。", "characters": ["kazuo", "ichiko", "sato"], "expressions": [{"id": "kazuo", "position": "left", "expression": "kazuo_general_05_neutral"}, {"id": "sato", "position": "right", "expression": "sato_01_smile"}] },
        { "id": "s09_06", "speaker": "sato", "text": "緊急時の連絡先はお渡ししましたね。24時間対応の訪問看護ステーションの番号です。", "characters": ["kazuo", "ichiko", "sato"], "expressions": [{"id": "ichiko", "position": "left", "expression": "ichiko_02_worried"}, {"id": "sato", "position": "right", "expression": "sato_05_neutral"}] },
        { "id": "s09_07", "speaker": "sato", "text": "介護者の負担軽減も大切です。ご家族だけで抱え込まず、使えるサービスは活用してくださいね。", "characters": ["kazuo", "ichiko", "sato"], "expressions": [{"id": "ichiko", "position": "left", "expression": "ichiko_05_neutral"}, {"id": "sato", "position": "right", "expression": "sato_07_serious"}] }
      ],
